                                                "sense_id": "036bcc84-2310-351d-a698-8023505f9e00",
                                                "text": "It may feel like video martyrdom to you, but it's just live, reality TV!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e75bbaf9-6e1d-4f55-9ea7-9e55e89e1bbe",
                                                "sense_id": "036bcc84-2310-351d-a698-8023505f9e00",
                                                "text": "Historically, reality TV has spiked in popularity during times of societal and economic hardship. “If you look at literature on why people watch reality TV, that’s one of the main reasons: escapism,” said Danielle J. Lindemann, the author of “True Story: What Reality TV Says About Us.”"
                                            }
